# Notion

Call Notion as the connected user through the Notion MCP server connected to
this session. The session's MCP relay attaches the user's credential on every
call; never ask for or handle credentials yourself.

{{ACTION_AVAILABILITY_SECTION}}

## Usage

Read tools (the connected user, users, search, pages, blocks, databases,
queries) run freely. The writes are creating pages, appending content,
commenting, updating pages, updating blocks, and deleting blocks. Read tools
that paginate should be capped with a result limit to keep your context
small.

